window.products.push({"id":334077,"name":"Beautiful Gift, 23 OZ Clear Tea Pot with Flower Totem Tea Infuser, Stovetop, Microwave & Dishwasher Safe Tea Kettle, Herbal & Loose Tea Maker by Heat ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.06,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NT4tcphjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌿 TOP GRADE QUALITY – The teapot is mouth blown by master glassblowers and made from top grade heat resistant borosilicate glass that could withstand instantaneous temperature differences between -4℉ to 300℉, making it safe for stovetop and microwave. The scratch resistant material and wide mouth user friendly design allows it to be easily cleaned both by hand and by dishwasher. 🌿 REMOVABLE INFUSER - The fine mesh infuser filter is made with high-grade 304' stainless steel with food-safe PVD that could filter ultra-fine tea leaf particles. This means you can use it to brew loose tea, herbal tea. The infuser's beautiful original filter patterns are designed to look like a miniature garden inside the teapot. The infuser has a height of 3 inches and a diameter width of 1.93 inches, plenty of space for the brewing tea leaves to swirl around and float freely. 🌿 HEAT-INSULATED LID – The strainer lid’s innovative double wall design provides structural heat insulation, keeping it cool and safe to the touch when brewing tea or removing the lid. 🌿 DRIP PROOF SPOUT – The spout’s gooseneck shape and exact water cut-off points are optimized to give you precise control, ensuring that no dripping or leakages will occur when serving tea, allowing you to pour every last drop into your cup without spilling. 🌿 SATISFACTION GUARANTEED – We at EILONG have a focus on the art of tea, teapots and tea accessories, we strive to be the tea brand of choice for tea enthusiasts worldwide, EILONG is dedicated to providing the best customer service and user experience possible. If at any point you are not satisfied with our products, please contact us directly so that we can provide you with the best solution for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NT4tcphjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eilong","source_asin":"B09KL938DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334077","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KL938DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KL938DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
