window.products.push({"id":334137,"name":"Impress Life Independence Day String Lights, USA American Stars Flag Lighting 4th Jul. Red White Blue 10ft 40 LEDs with Remote, Powered by Battery & U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n6QVCsohL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Festive String Lights Decorated With Stars: Corresponding blue, white and red clasps perfectly echo the festive vibe, the festive string lights decorated with stars can light up your room, this is the perfect string of lights It has 10 feet, 30 star clasps pieces. Battery Operation:The battery box requires 3 AA batteries (not included) and provides usb power, which contains a remote control with a remote range of about 5 meters. Use USB power to reduce the use of batteries, but also to reduce maintenance care costs and better protect the environment. Remote Control and Auto Timer: Equipped with a 17-key remote control and 2/4/6/8 hours timing settings, allowing you to turn on/off the candles without touching, change the blinking light mode, adjust the brightness level, and set different timing modes To meet your various needs. The Perfect Gift:Great gift for children and adults. You can use it for DIY unique gifts to your family or friends, suitable for theme parties, bedroom, living room, holiday indoor and outdoor decoration. If there is any quality problem, you can contact me anytime. WARNING: Please REMOVE the BATTERIES when you use USB power. DO NOT soak battery box in water. Low-quality batteries may damage the electronic panel and affect the length of use time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n6QVCsohL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Impress Life","source_asin":"B0B56BFHND","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B56BFHND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B56BFHND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
