window.products.push({"id":334181,"name":"MASSO Butcher Knife, 12\" Black Meat Cleaver Boning Knife, Chef Chopping Cleaver Cooking Knife, High Carbon Steel Kitchen Knife with 3\" knife sharpener","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519KPUfh3vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Unique Design-Butcher knife】The perfect design of butcher knife is in the front blade for slicing and the rear blade for hacking bones. The wavy design of the thickened blade back can be used as a heavy tool for beating, which is simple and labor-saving. The wavy and small air holes close to the blade are designed to prevent sticking when cutting and lock the original flavor of the food. 【Stunning Design-Cleaver Knife】 A black oxide film of cleaver knife is formed on the surface, which is non-permeable, easy to clean and has strong corrosion resistance. Chinese chef knife's handle design is ergonomic, and it is very non-slip. This meat knife has a hole at the top corner for easy and convenient storage on a hanging hook or peg in your kitchen or restaurant. 【Mini Pocket Knife】The chef knife blade is made of stainless steel and the handle is made of high quality acrylic, so the knife is easy to hold and use and not easy to rust. The surface of the mini chef knife is engraved with a handcrafted damascus pattern which can be used as opening mails, envelops, letters or cutting tapes on boxes and the necklace pendant decoration knife. 【Perfect Matching- Knife Sharpener】The main materials are PP, tungsten steel and ceramics which is sturdy and durable. It is easy to carry with a hanging chain design. The kitchen knife's handle and base are not easy to slide, and it is an indispensable treasure with a chopping knife. 【Ideal Gift Choice】A convenient and perfect combination: cooking Knife, knife Sharpener and mini pocket knife. Who doesn't love such a convenient and beautiful gift? Hurry up and give this butcher knife set to your family, friends, lovers on Christmas, Birthday, Thanksgiving, Father's Mother's Day, and housewarming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519KPUfh3vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MASSO","source_asin":"B09Z2G13QY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z2G13QY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z2G13QY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
