window.products.push({"id":334202,"name":"CDL 5 inches Las Vegas Ornament Souvenirs Hand Painted Glass Mouth Blown Glass Christmas Tree ornametns Travel Memorabilia (5\", Las Vegas G68)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ykgp4wXYL._AC_SL1012_.jpg","description":"From a pieces of glass tube to this pieces of nice shaped handcrafts. This requires a series of skilled labor-intensive steps that you may interested in to know. · 1, Get glass tubes nearly melt by flames · 2, Mouth-blown it into molds quickly and then get the basic glass ornament shape · 3, Silver liquid then need to apply to inner of glass ornaments to get shiny and nice background for outside decoration. · 4, Hand-painted and glittered apply to outside of the glass ornaments. If you buy and have them with you, count how many colors and how many kinds of glitters that were used in these glass ornaments. You will be surprised by the number.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ykgp4wXYL._AC_SL1012_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CDL-GLASS BLOWN","source_asin":"B01MCZGQ92","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MCZGQ92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MCZGQ92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
