window.products.push({"id":334240,"name":"Anolon 7 Quart Covered Windsor Stockpot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419MFNVTZPL._AC_.jpg","description":"The windsor shape is ideal for reducing sauces. Whether you're boiling pasta, making a batch of chili or spaghetti sauce, this pan is just the right size. The stockpot is made of hard-anodized, a material preferred for its even heat distribution, giving y","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419MFNVTZPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anolon","source_asin":"B000AA89H6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000AA89H6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000AA89H6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":334241,"name":"THiCket Inspired Raygun Refillable Butane Torch Lighter, Home Kitchen and Cooking Torch with Safety Lock and Kickstand (Butane Not Included) (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EzuMhFtlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY TO USE : Very easy use! To ignite the torch, fill the torch using a can of butane, unlatch the safety lock, turn the lever knob to activate the gas (you should hear a noise once gas is on) and push the trigger to ignite your flame. REFILLABLE : This torch is easily refillable and works with most refined butane brands. To refill is very simple- just turn your torch upside down and push your butane can into the tank's opening for 5-10 seconds. The torch's tank is full once the butane starts spitting out completely. We highly recommend to wait 30 seconds to 1 minute before igniting your flame to ensure maximized flame intensity. *Always make sure to turn off the gas using the lever knob after use.* ADJUSTABLE FLAME INTENSITY : Not only is the flame strong, but the torch's flame and intensity can be adjusted depending on your liking. By using the lever knob on the Raygun Torch, once the gas is on, you can adjust the knob from left to right (left making it stronger, right making it smaller) to cater to your needs. Turning the knob completely to the right will shut off the gas and turn of your torch so igniting the gas will be required again afterward. SAFETY LOCK : The Raygun Torch has a safety lock installed right underneath the ignition trigger to ensure the utmost safety for our customers. We recommend when not in use, always make sure to have the gas turned off and safety lock activated. This torch is not to be used around or with children and should be used responsibly. When safety lock is activated, the trigger is disabled and will not work. KICKSTAND INCLUDED : When figuring out how to store the torch after use, we made it very simple. A kickstand is attached to the Raygun Torch which can be placed anywhere from a bedroom shelf to a kitchen table or cabinet. The kickstand allows the torch to sit at an angle that is very aethetically pleasing - a great novelty item to display!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EzuMhFtlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THiCket","source_asin":"B0BWKR44VX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWKR44VX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWKR44VX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
