window.products.push({"id":334502,"name":"HDCAXKJ Luxury Velvet Seat Covers for Dining Room Chairs Super Stretch Dining Chair Cover Set of 6 Kitchen Chair Slipcovers Stretchable Dinning Chairs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W4yV+7K3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft Velvet & High Stretch: Made of high density luxurious velvet plush fabric, which is super soft, smooth and comfortable. Feels cozy and warm when you sitting on our premium chair slipcover in this cold winter, it's thick and Durable. Material includes 95% polyester and 5% spandex, so the office chair seat cover is highly stretchable to fit most chairs easily NON SLIP: To get better fitting effect and staying in place, our dining chair seat cover is equipped with elastic band and anti-slip ties, firmly fix the dinning chair slip covers in place to avoid slipping or sliding. Easy to fit, wrinkle resistance. Luxury material, exquisite design and workmanship create a custom look, make old chair appear brand new. The dining chair covers set of 6 are suitable for chair with seat cushion such as upholstered dinner chair or office chair Wide Application: Our dining chair cover will give your old or damaged chair seat a totally new look while protecting your chairs from daily stains, dust, dog cat scratching, wear and tear, especially if you have kids and pets at home. It can be used as seat covers for dining room chairs, office chair cover, desk chair cover, computer chair cover, kitchen chair covers, it is universal stretch chair covers for dining room, hotel, wedding, banquet, meeting, ceremony, bar, patio and more UPGRADED FIT: Super stretchy feature make the removable dining chair slipcovers fit for most chair styles. Please check the Measuring Guide of our dining chair protectors covers in Photos to measuring your chair seat cushion size before purchasing, our decorative chair cushion covers are suitable for chair seats with width 14\"-20\"/35-50cm and depth 14\"-20\"/35-50cm and thickness 1.5\"-3\"/3.5-7cm EASY CARE: Machine Washable for easy care and maintenance, keep fresh look after repeated washing. Separately wash in cold water on the gentle cycle, do not use bleach. Tumble Dry Low. No ironing needed. A Must-have fitted chair seat covers for dining room. Our belief is that quality speaks louder than anything! We provide 24*7 friendly customer support and also back our modern dining room chair covers for 18 months, try it with confidence","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W4yV+7K3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HDCAXKJ","source_asin":"B08M3LXHQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M3LXHQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M3LXHQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":334503,"name":"Salton ID1654 Portable Induction Cooker, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x9ZLolWLL._AC_SL1430_.jpg","description":"The Salton ID1654 portable induction cooker is energy efficient - no heat loss to the surrounding area. More energy efficient than conventional cooking. Uniform heating with instant and accurate control for better results. No open flames or hot elements - heat is generated as a stainless steel or iron pot is placed on a cooktop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x9ZLolWLL._AC_SL1430_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Salton","source_asin":"B01N6AVGL9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N6AVGL9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N6AVGL9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":334504,"name":"KIVENJAJA Velvet Accent Chair, Modern Comfy Tufted Upholstered Armchair for Living Room & Bedroom, Reading Arm Chair Single Sofa with Rose Gold Metal ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LC1XYzEdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfy and Supportive: KIVENJAJA living room chairs are padded with high-density thick sponge for maximum comfort and support, allowing you to rest throughout the day without sinking. Velvet surface features a friendly touch and looks new even after long-term use. Stylish and Ergonomic Design: 25.98In extra-wide seat space and equal-height armrests are designed to add extra comfort. Ergonomically curved back fits your back and helps to relieve pressure. With an elegant tufted and lively color design, this accent chair matches a variety of decor styles. Durable Structure: Our reading chair adopts strong wooden frame and metal legs to achieve a sturdy structure, which can hold up to 220 pounds and ensure long-lasting durability. Non-slip pads at the bottom of the legs help to prevent the armchair from sliding and scratching the floor. Enjoy Colorful Time: This velvet chair with its lively color is the perfect addition to your bedroom, living room, balcony, and study room. You can sit on it to relieve fatigue from work, enjoy a relaxing time with a cup of coffee or reading. The moderate size of our comfy chairs is also the perfect partner for small spaces. Easy Assembly: Simply assemble KIVENJAJA single sofa chair by following the steps in the instructions (included in the package), then you get a great piece of furniture. Customer satisfaction is our top priority, if you have any questions about our sofa chairs, please don’t hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LC1XYzEdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KIVENJAJA","source_asin":"B0B41H27G5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B41H27G5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B41H27G5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":334505,"name":"Bamboo Dryer Sheet holder,Minimalist Light Luxury Style Washer Dryer Sheet Dispenser, Transparent Container Storage Box for Laundry Room Decoration, R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71igGJmYrWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Eco-friendly bamboo dryer sheet dispenser:This clear rectangular tissue box is made of clear PET resin and durable bamboo cover. Simple yet modern in design, it adds a beautiful decorative touch to your laundry room, bathroom, nightstand, office and home. Exquisite Craftsmanship: Unlike other cheap dry sheet holders that fall apart easily,Made of high-quality resin, our dryer sheet dispensers are durable, odor-free, clear-textured, and burr-free, so you can use them with confidence. Easy to use: The transparent body allows you to easily check the amount of paper towels left in the napkin holder, and it can be easily replenished by simply opening the bamboo cover. MULTI-PURPOSE: This tissue box can hold a large amount of tissues, as a main table for daily use; also suitable as a dry paper dispenser in the laundry room; also suitable for storing face masks. Ideal gift: It is really an ideal gift for family, friends or colleagues as weddings, anniversaries, special occasions, and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71igGJmYrWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PRELETOCH","source_asin":"B09Y8XDYRK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y8XDYRK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y8XDYRK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":334506,"name":"OREMAKE 8-INCH Kiritsuke Chef's Knife, Japanese Damascus T-CO Steel 69-Layer Forged Cooking Knife, Multi-Purpose Professional Kitchen Knife for cuttin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tYg4xQPML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The OreMake Sheepdog knife series strives to meet the needs of culinary enthusiasts. This series combines a look inspired by Sheepdog pocket knives with the latest Japanese Damascus steel (T-CO69). It boasts a forged 69-layer construction that creates an eye-pleasing Damascus pattern and protects and strengthens the core. With a higher carbon content than AUS-10 or VG-10, the T-CO steel core provides superior out-of-the-box sharpness and edge retention. The 2 flanking layers of nickel alloy improve the core’s corrosion resistance. Each knife is perfectly balanced with an ergonomic, brass-accented G10 handle for comfortable control and a high-end look. The Nakiri knife is a Japanese-style vegetable knife designed for chopping, slicing, and dicing vegetables and herbs. It is also excellent for cutting fruits. The Kiritsuke knife is a multipurpose Japanese-style knife with the main purpose of slicing fish. It can also be used to slice meat or cut vegetables, herbs, and fruits.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tYg4xQPML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OREMAKE","source_asin":"B09VFN2763","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VFN2763","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VFN2763","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
