window.products.push({"id":334511,"name":"SOUFEEL Personalized Alarm Clock for Bedrooms Custom Photo Electronic LED Time Display Digital Clock 1.4-inch Cubic Mini Wooden Clocks Customized Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615b90RzCXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"❤Fashionable Design & Innovative Style❤This wooden alarm clock is designed in the shape of a cube, the color of the wood pattern gives you a feeling of being in nature. The middle with LED display is a combination of environmental protection and modern design concept. This must be the most exquisite alarm clock you have ever seen, but also the best choice to decorate the bedroom, coffee table. ❤Customized Digital Alarm Clock❤In addition to the basic alarm clock functions, our alarm clock also gives you the ability to personalize it by uploading a meaningful photo to the alarm clock's dial, making the alarm clock a gift for someone. Giving your beloved one a customized alarm clock is like saying to him/her, \"In the future, I want us to be together forever! ❤Compact Size & High-Quality Material❤This is a small desktop clock which measures 2.48 inches * 2.48 inches * 2.36 inches. Perfect for bedside table, office or as a portable travel clock. This alarm clock is made of wood, pure hand exquisitely polished, any surface of the alarm clock is smooth to the touch, do not worry about scratching your hands. Customized area using UV printing technology, making the photo display more realistic. ❤Wonderful Gifts❤This is the perfect gift for everyone, with a simple and generous appearance plus an exclusive photo that can be customized. Especially suitable for parents, family, children, friends, etc. Suitable as birthday gifts, Christmas gifts, anniversary gifts, Thanksgiving gifts, New Year gifts, Valentine's Day gifts, Father's Day gifts, etc. ❤After-sales Service❤ We always try our best to provide high quality personalized alarm clock to make every customer happy. If you have any questions about this personalized digital clock, please feel free to contact us. It will be our pleasure to give you a wonderful shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615b90RzCXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOUFEEL","source_asin":"B09LQ8KC55","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LQ8KC55","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LQ8KC55","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
