window.products.push({"id":334534,"name":"Weidear Hallway Runner Rug with Rubber Backing, Laundry Room Rug Non Slip, Washable Outdoor Indoor Rug Carpet Runner, Customized Area Rugs Mat for Ent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qqa7+PwmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size Customized Carpet-This washable hallway runner rug is easy to cut.Just select or cut according to the size can simply decorate your area room. We provide the width 2ft 3ft 4ft and the length from 2 to 82 ft custom size. The low pile carpet runner is also an excellent choice as long hallway runner rug mat for entryway indoor.Note: The color of each batch of carpets have a difference. If it needs to be placed in the same area, it is recommended to buy a same batch of rugs. Premium Area Rugs-Backed non slip runner rug is wear-resistant with soft and durable synthetic material. Color of waterproof outdoor runner will not fade easily in sun. The textured low pile indoor outdoor runner adds visual interest, low-maintenance. Easy to Clean-The carpet runner rugs with rubber backing is easy to clean, simply use a vacuum cleaner, or sweep with a broom, or pat and shake the backing outdoor mat. You also can simply sweep away dirt with water and let it air dry. Perfect for Outdoor Indoor-The floor mat is suitable for all indoor outdoor, such as bedroom, bathroom, porch, kitchen, entryway, laundry room, deck, balcony, garage, office, mud room, also the best choice for crowded areas such as corridors, living rooms. This Household carpets outdoor rug gives you a relaxed experience. It is comfortable to walk on, both pets and children will love it. Valuable decoration-The soft entrance carpets rug are laid in your house. Large size can be laid at weddings, parties and outdoor activities. Indoor outdoor runner with rubber back helps you not have to directly touch the cold ground in winter, and it will not make too much noise when you walk on it, making your life more comfortable!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qqa7+PwmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Weidear","source_asin":"B0B2PQZJ3Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2PQZJ3Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2PQZJ3Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":334535,"name":"Hypnotic Gems Materials: 2 lbs (Best Variety) of a 26 Stone Mix from Madagascar - 26 Different Stone Types in Every Bag! Raw Natural Rough Rock Crysta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715uot6tcPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Hypnotic Gems hand packed Extraordinary Mix from Madagascar includes at least 24-26 different stone types in every single bag giving this mix the best variety of any Madagascar rough stone mix on the market today! Hypnotic Gems makes up these bags by adding one stone at a time right here in the USA to guarantee at least 24-26 material types are in every single bag. You aren't taking a random chance at hopefully getting large variety since each bag includes a minimum of 24-26 stone types every time!In every bag you may receive: Amazonite, Amethyst, Neon Blue Apatite, Green Opal, Indigo Gabbro, Sea Jasper, Agate, Blue Calcite, Carnelian, Chestnut Jasper, Chrysocolla, Crocodile Jasper, Clear Quartz, Desert Jasper, Epidote in Matrix, Fire Quartz, Girasol, Hematite, Labradorite, Orange Calcite, Petrified Wood, Rhodonite, Rose Quartz, Septarian, Yellow Jasper and Zebradorite! For some materials you may receive more than one piece to equal the total weight purchased.The material Hypnotic Gems uses aren't just scrap stones but are quality mined stones from specific veins. To save on costs other manufacturers just use whatever scraps are laying around and it is possible to get a lot of dull stones. With the Hypnotic Gems hand bagging production line, you will only receive quality stones which are perfect for tumbling, cabbing, metaphysical, decorations, crafts and any other purpose which is limited only by your imagination!Please note that these are natural earth mined stones and every piece of material is unique. All pieces received will not be the exact same size, shape, color or look identical to our images. What we do guarantee is that every piece will be spectacular and contain a strong positive energy that can only be found in the Hypnotic Gems brand of stones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715uot6tcPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hypnotic Gems","source_asin":"B00GWU5SKE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GWU5SKE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GWU5SKE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
