window.products.push({"id":334789,"name":"BHSOSO Cooling Blanket for Hot Sleepers Cooling Comforter,51x67 Blue,Stays Cool On Warm Nights, Uses Cold Feeling Material Q-Max>0.35","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iwDrfM7ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄[FABRIC-COOL FEELING FABRI] Made of special cool feeling fabric with cool feeling value (Q-max) over 0.35 (most cool feeling fabrics are only 0.2), 35% PE + 65% nylon on the front side and 100% nylon on the back side, which can absorb body heat. ❄[Cool Feeling Blankets - Easy Care]These blankets are hand washable as well as completely machine washable. Convenient to keep your blanket fresh, clean and odor free but please note that it is best to put the blanket in a laundry mesh bag to prevent tangling and damage to these blankets, especially for those of you who don't have time to do housework. ❄[Introduction of using feeling]Our cool feeling blanket material is soft and comfortable, when your skin touches it, you will feel like on top of a soft cloud, at the same time it will absorb the heat emitted from your body, leaving you in a cool and comfortable temperature, super comfortable experience, you deserve it. ❄[Wide range of use] Our Cool Feeling Blanket is perfect for indoors, outdoors, and anywhere you want a comfortable blanket to keep you cool, but of course it's not just for keeping the heat off, you can also use it to keep you warm in an overly cold, air-conditioned room. ❄[Easy to carry and store]Great for carrying around, traveling, outdoors, in the car, or at backyard parties, camping, on airplanes, anywhere you want a cozy blanket to cool off and snuggle up with. The large size can be shared with family, friends, lovers, or as a gift for anyone you love, great as an anniversary gift, holiday gift, Christmas gift, birthday gift, Valentine's Day gift, Father's Day or Mother's Day gift. ❄[About Us]If you have any questions about our blankets, you can contact us promptly through Amazon, and we will definitely give you a satisfactory answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iwDrfM7ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BHSOSO","source_asin":"B0B393B9SX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334789","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B393B9SX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B393B9SX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
