window.products.push({"id":334793,"name":"Vergiano Highest Quality Premium Stainless Steel Easy Clean No Pulp Garlic Press & Crusher - Ginger Mincer & Chopper - Super Strong Crushing with Extr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BTVcmaHJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's time to toss out that old inefficient garlic press and replace it with this exceptional one by Vergiano! This is because our garlic press showcases an innovative design, which makes crushing spices such as garlic and gingers a real breeze. As a matter of fact, our exclusive garlic crusher is the preferred choice among both professional and at-home chefs for a number of reasons.  First, it is made out of a fine RUST-RESISTANT STAINLESS STEEL that will look great for years to come. Second, our garlic press is equipped with an ADVANCED PULP CRUSHER which effectively crushes the garlic clove into a fine pulp-free garnish. The ergonomic handles of this powerful garlic crusher are covered in a NON-SLIP LINING which makes gripping and squeezing easier than ever before. For your convenience, our garlic press is also DISHWASHER SAFE. All you have to do is simply place it on the top shelf of your dishwasher and run a normal cycle to get it squeaky clean.  You have absolutely nothing to lose by adding our garlic press to your collection of kitchen tools and accessories as it is backed by our 100% LIFETIME WARRANTY. Click 'Add to Cart' to order your Pulp-Free Garlic Press today! More info on the Garlic Press A garlic press (otherwise called a garlic crusher in Australia and New Zealand), is a kitchen utensil to pulverize garlic cloves proficiently by driving them through a matrix of little openings, more often than not with some kind of cylinder. Numerous garlic presses likewise have a gadget with a coordinating network of gruff pins to wipe out the openings. Our device comes with a matching grid of blunt pins to clean out the holes. Garlic smashed by a press is by and large accepted to have an alternate flavor from minced garlic, a greater amount of garlic's solid flavor mixes are freed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BTVcmaHJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vergiano","source_asin":"B01ARFWBOK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ARFWBOK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ARFWBOK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
