window.products.push({"id":334847,"name":"Bodum Thermo-glass Pavina Double Wall Thermo-Glasses - Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fZgY4pyWL._AC_SL1062_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Bodum pavina double wall shot glass is 3.5 ounces in size and can be used for cold or warm beverages. Its distinct design is appealing to the eye when filled with your favourite beverage. With its double layer of borosilicate glass it appears as though the liquid is floating within the glass. They will not sweat when filled with a cold beverage, so you will not have to use a coaster. The double wall creates a thermal effect, helping to keep your cold drinks cold and your hot drinks hot for longer periods of time. These mouth blown glasses are an exciting product for any home, restaurant or cafe and they are a definite conversation piece. Amazon.com What's not to love? These handsome glasses combine great looks with insulating temperature control qualities and anti-condensation protection to boot. Keep your tea hot in the morning and your cocktail cool in the evening with this set of two 7-ounce tumblers. These glasses, like all Bodum Pavina glasses, are hand made and mouth blown, and cleverly feature a two glass walls, trapping air between the walls to provide insulation, keeping hot drinks hot and cold drinks cold. As an added bonus, the dual layers prevent condensation accumulating on the outside of cold drinks and dripping onto your wood tables. The design is not only functional but adds a striking visual aspect to the containers also: beverages seem to float within the glass due to the double-walled design. This visual appeal is enhanced because the outer layer is shaped like a traditional rounded juice glass, while the inner layer has a more tapered profile. Made of borosilicate glass, the set is dishwasher safe. The design has won several awards and rave reviews, notably the European iF Design Award. Match with any Bodum Pavina glassware, or coordinate with Bodum's other double-walled insulated glassware patterns, Canteen and Assam. --Jeff Dalto Editor's Note: Because each glass is mouth-blown, each one may have slight differences in height, thickness, and weight. Bodum recommends using care when placing ice into the glass to avoid fracturing the inner layer. You should also avoid using metal spoons or placing the glass into a crowded dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fZgY4pyWL._AC_SL1062_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B096MFVMYP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096MFVMYP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096MFVMYP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
