window.products.push({"id":334864,"name":"Lumisys 8500 Sq Ft 125 Pints Commercial Grade Dehumidifiers with Pump for Basements, Large Rooms, and Home with Auto or Manual Drainage | 50db Industr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":429.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GoqZJtcvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALUMINUM ROTATING KNOB AND DOUBLE RINGS AS UNIQUE FEATURES: Our uniquely designed knob can be casually rotated to change the set humidity, with the current humidity level displayed on the knob's centrally integrated LED screen as well as its inner ring. Tri-color indicator positioned on the knob's outer ring shows the ambient humidity range. PUMP + ADVANCED AIR FILTER = MORE TECHNOLOGY: Pump allows for convenient drainage to any location up to 19 feet away. It frees you from checking the water level in the water tank and emptying the tank periodically. The replaceable and washable air filter (integrated with the back shell) provides cleaner and fresher air by decomposing odor, allergents, and other pollutants; it covers up to 8500 sq. ft. A 15.74 x 14.09 x 26.22 INCHES SIMULTANEOUS DEHUMIDIFIER AND CLOTH DRYER: dehumidify with three operation modes: intelligent mode for daily use facilitated by auto shut-off at your ideal humidity level; sleeping mode for nighttime; continuous mode for efficient drying under extreme moist weather as well as for fast clothes drying. ALL FUNCTIONS EQUIPPED AT YOUR IDEAL USAGE: powerful compressor enables efficient dehumidification up to 125 pints (under 95°F, 90%RH condition); child lock protects children from unintentional touches; 24hr timer allows you to set auto turn-on & turn-off time; 360º wheels enable easy movement; visible 2.14-gallon huge water tank and drainage pipe provide flexible drainage options. WARRANTY GUARANTEED: 1-year paperless (environmentally friendly) warranty is provided, automatically activated once upon receiving. If you have any problems with our dehumidifier, please feel free to reach out. We will reply and offer solutions within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GoqZJtcvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUMISYS","source_asin":"B0C5RLRWSV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5RLRWSV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5RLRWSV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
