window.products.push({"id":334949,"name":"Crafty Croc Removable Chalkboard Labels, Pack of 64, Large Rectangle Adhesive Stickers For Spice Jar, Mason Jar, Canister and Bottle, Size 3.5\" x 2\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fBM2fp7nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Secret to Organizing Your Life! Large Premium Chalkboard Labels Make Managing Your Home a Breeze - A Whopping 64 Adhesive Labels Per Packet Means There Are Loads To Go Round! - Large 3” x 2 ½” Stickers Give You Plenty Of Room To Write And Are Ideal Size For Most Applications - Rectangle Designs – 32 With Square Corners And 32 With Scalloped Corners Provide A Sharp Minimalist and Uniform Appearance To Your Labels - Finest Self Adhesive Backing Keeps Stickers In Place But Makes Them Easy To Remove With No Residue - EASY TO WIPE CLEAN and Reuse with Crafty Croc Liquid Chalk Markers or Regular Chalk - EASY TO WRITE ON Matt Surface Makes the Chalkboard Label Stickers Easy To Write On The Best Chalkboard Labels For The Job So, what separates Crafty Croc adhesive chalkboard labels from other brands? It’s simple really. We offer more premium quality chalkboard sticker labels per packet (a huge 64 large rectangles) than our competitors so you know you’ve got plenty to use for all your organizational needs. Additionally, in this packet we have dispensed with all the “fancy” shapes and focused on plain large rectangles (32 labels) and large rectangle with scalloped corners (32 labels) making it easier to create a more uniform and organized look in your pantry or kitchen. Furthermore, our unfailing commitment to the satisfaction of you our customers that you have come to love, will leave you grinning from ear to ear. You’re going to love: - Premium quality - Simple rectangle shapes to give style and uniformity to your storage needs - A massive 64 labels per packet! Full Money Back Guarantee Crafty Croc products are backed with a full Money Back guarantee. If for any reason you are not satisfied with our products, contact us directly and we'll bend over backwards to ensure your satisfaction. Order Now Go ahead and hit the Buy Now button above to start organizing your stuff!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fBM2fp7nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crafty Croc","source_asin":"B07FWCCKFL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FWCCKFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FWCCKFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
