window.products.push({"id":334967,"name":"Chill Sack Huge Memory Foam Bean Bag Pillow, Charcoal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714SGg9m1JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need a new place to chill? How about a form-fitting memory foam chair pillow that's big enough to lounge comfortably? Introducing the Chill Sack. FUN FOR EVERYONE: Add some fun to your basement hangout, dorm room, or bedroom with this super comfy bean bag chair pillow! The Chill Sack bean bag is ideal for kids, teenagers, college students, and stressed out adults. Position it either upright or lay it flat - use it while watching your favorite movies, tv shows, or while playing your favorite game. OVERSIZED LOUNGER: Chill Sack is the ideal bean bag sofa to snuggle in to with a favorite blanket. The bean bag measures 70\" L x 58\" W x 12\" H and is just the right size for relaxing in any room: large enough for an adult to lounge and watch a movie, but not so big that it takes over a small room. SHREDDED MEMORY FOAM: Bounce back with comfort! Each bean bag chair is stuffed with a shredded, soft, memory foam blend that is highly durable so you can flop and fall on it all you want and it will never lose its shape. COMFY FURNITURE COVER: Covered in a soft micro fiber material, the Chill Sack offers ultimate comfort and unmatched functionality. The removable cover can be machine washed and is resistant to stains, and discoloration so your new favorite lounger always looks and feels brand new. Every Chill Sack has double stitched seams for extra strength and extended use. MADE IN THE USA: Chill Sacks are proudly made right here at home in the USA with high quality, light and fluffy, shredded foam, premium zippers, and hand selected fabrics that are double stitched for maximum strength and durability. - Dimensions: 12\" H x 70\" W x 58\" D - Weight: 36 pounds - Cover Material: Micro Fiber - Filling: Shredded Memory Foam Blend","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714SGg9m1JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chill Sack","source_asin":"B01AVYPT4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-334967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AVYPT4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AVYPT4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
